  {
   "id": "vIc0bwMyf2AJ",
   "from": "Ben Bond-Lamberty",
   "author": "f4249b01b99d0091",
   "date": "2015-05-01T17:08:34Z",
   "subject": "Re: ggplot2 does not display legends for features within geom_abline",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If you look at the help page for geom_abline, you&#39;ll see that its `show_guide` parameter defaults to FALSE. You want to set it to true.<div><br></div><div>Ben</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, May 1, 2015 at 9:57 AM, Guilherme Rocha <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gvr...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Dear ggplotters,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">I am having trouble getting ggplot to display legends for colors and line types when they are only defined within an geom_abline.</span></div><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I&#39;ve added a very simple example below. It generates the plot as shown (no legends).</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I&#39;ve also tried adding a scale_color_manual to the plot, but that did not appear to do the trick. Does anybody know how to make ggplot2 display the legends?</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">Any ideas of what might be happening?</span></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:normal\">  Disclaimer: </span></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">  </span><span style=\"line-height:19.5px\">I have posted the same question on stackoverflow (</span></span><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/29988050/ggplot2-does-not-display-legends-for-features-within-geom-abline\" style=\"line-height:19.5px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/29988050/ggplot2-does-not-display-legends-for-features-within-geom-abline&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369164220000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16vJ3224CUSBp7zhwEWwjX\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/29988050/ggplot2-does-not-display-legends-for-features-within-geom-abline</a><span style=\"line-height:19.5px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">). </span></p><div><div>  Is this encouraged, discouraged, doesn&#39;t matter?</div></div><div><br></div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">);</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nxy_data    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">runif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">100</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> min</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">-0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> max</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> \r\n                        y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">runif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">100</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> min</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">-0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> max</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">));</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nslope_data </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">slope  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">-1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">-0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n                        model  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> paste0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;m&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n                        robust </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Robust&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Non-robust&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nmerged_data </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">xy_data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> slope_data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nslope_plot </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> \r\n  ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  geom_point</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">xy_data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">     aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  geom_abline</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">slope_data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">intercept</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> slope</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">slope</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> color</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">model</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> linetype</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">robust</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\nggsave</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">plot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">slope_plot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> file</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;no_legend_slope_plot.png&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></code></pre><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"h